        "text": "After a comprehensive analysis of recent property sales, no comparable properties were found that strictly meet all of the specified criteria for the subject property at 556 Bolton Rd NW, Atlanta, GA 30331.\n\nNumerous properties were investigated in the vicinity, and while some met individual criteria such as location, sale date, or size, none satisfied all requirements simultaneously. The most significant challenges in finding suitable \"comps\" were the strict year of construction (1997-2017) and the single-family detached property type requirements, as many recent sales in the area were for townhomes or homes built outside of this timeframe.\n\nFor example, the property at 483 Fairlane Cir NW, Atlanta, GA 30331, sold on October 21, 2025, for $247,000, has a compliant square footage of 1,622 and was built in 2004. However, it was disqualified as it has five bedrooms, which is outside the specified two-to-four-bedroom range. Another property at 830 Sandy Creek Dr NW, Atlanta, GA 30331, sold on August 12, 2025, for $105,000 and met the bedroom and bathroom count. It was ultimately not a suitable comparable because it was built in 1960 and at 1,200 square feet, it falls within the acceptable size range. Properties such as 760 Celeste Ln SW and 931 Society Cir SW were also disqualified as they are townhomes, not single-family detached houses.\n\nGiven the very specific constraints, no properties matching all the required attributes could be identified from the available recent sales data."
